s, generated syntax, program↔log | §4.1 `:yin/source-batch`; nested `source-call` into the log copy;                |\n1155:|    | correspondence, event schema home, anonymous macros (astra P2-8)               | `expansion-root` names the log copy, correspondence not promised;                |\n1156:|    |                                                                                | `macro/event-schema`; `:yin/macro-name` absent for inline lambdas                |\n1168:| 14 | `program-out` `m = ev` would be a cross-medium ref; event attrs dropped from   | Decision 9 and §4.1: `program-out` carries `default-op`; `macro/event-schema`    |\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
